<title>JAPAN: Nihon Matai - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nihon Matai - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 32.35		vs	   32.29</p>
<p> Operating	  513    million	  vs	  723    million</p>
<p> Current	    651    million	  vs	  668    million</p>
<p> Net		  290    million	  vs	  328    million</p>
